{"schemaVersion":2,"dialogueId":"Dlg_AED95D2F","title":"Olive outlines her manifesto","entry":"Dlg_AED95D2F::entry","exit":"Dlg_AED95D2F::exit","nodes":[{"id":"DFr_84637688","articyId":"72057645577601664","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Well hello! I love your style today. It's very... I-don't-give-a-fuck-how-I-look. Although you clearly do, because you actually look FABULOUS!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Well hello! I love your style today. It's very... I-don't-give-a-fuck-how-I-look. Although you clearly do, because you actually look FABULOUS!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43728","byteOffset":30873088,"byteLength":488}},{"id":"DFr_ECB78BE7","articyId":"72057645577601676","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"It's good of you to stop to chat. Everything's going well. I really have the formula down now.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's good of you to stop to chat. Everything's going well. I really have the formula down now.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":5,"name":"Smile"},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"40677","byteOffset":29717352,"byteLength":404}},{"id":"DFr_61AEC4C2","articyId":"72057645577601686","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"The soap! Patchouli and watermelon. It's the start of something big.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The soap! Patchouli and watermelon. It's the start of something big.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":1200.0,"y":-25.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"37157","byteOffset":28398408,"byteLength":412}},{"id":"DFr_130E530B","articyId":"72057645577601736","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"It's ready, but there's a small problem. It's not very clean yet. But I'm working on it!","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's ready, but there's a small problem. It's not very clean yet. But I'm working on it!","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24941","byteOffset":17316048,"byteLength":396}},{"id":"DFr_252227A9","articyId":"72057645577601742","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"That's good because the soap comes out a bit dirty.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"That's good because the soap comes out a bit dirty.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":6,"name":"Sad"},"position":{"x":1800.0,"y":-100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19843","byteOffset":15389968,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_ADC3F965","articyId":"72057645577601756","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Yes, the soap comes out a bit dirty. But that's not really a problem.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Yes, the soap comes out a bit dirty. But that's not really a problem.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":4,"name":"Shocked"},"position":{"x":2400.0,"y":125.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"19711","byteOffset":15339928,"byteLength":416}},{"id":"DFr_A5C1A4E1","articyId":"72057645577601779","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"The real goal of the soap isn't cleaning anyway. It's spreading the message.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"The real goal of the soap isn't cleaning anyway. It's spreading the message.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":3000.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"24420","byteOffset":17116304,"byteLength":384}},{"id":"DFr_E7528CCE","articyId":"72057645577601794","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"It's different on each soap. \"Revolutionary Power\", \"Rise Up\", \"Corp Heads Must Roll\", \"Solidarity Marches On\" and \"Mom's Spa Day.\"","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"It's different on each soap. \"Revolutionary Power\", \"Rise Up\", \"Corp Heads Must Roll\", \"Solidarity Marches On\" and \"Mom's Spa Day.\"","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":0,"name":"Unspecified"},"position":{"x":3600.0,"y":100.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"45428","byteOffset":31519232,"byteLength":476}},{"id":"DFr_64BEA8A3","articyId":"72057645577601830","type":"line","className":"DemeanorTemplate","speaker":"Olive Nek","text":"Alright! Nice one. I'll add you to the mailing list.","speakerId":"Ntt_85F94ABB","textSource":"localization","pronounText":{"TextHeVersion":"Alright! Nice one. I'll add you to the mailing list.","TextSheVersion":"~","TextTheyVersion":"~"},"effects":[],"conditions":[],"script":"","demeanor":{"value":3,"name":"Happy"},"position":{"x":4500.0,"y":250.0},"source":{"file":"resources.assets","pathId":"43492","byteOffset":30782696,"byteLength":360}},{"id":"DFr_368C1064","articyId":"72057645577601837","type":